🟢 MLOps

MLOps = Machine Learning + Operations

MLOps applies DevOps principles specifically to machine-learning systems.

The important difference is that ML has not only code, but also:

Dataset
Data preprocessing
Model training
Model version
Model evaluation
Model deployment
Model monitoring
Model retraining


===

Example:

        Dataset
           ↓
   Data Preprocessing
           ↓
      Model Training
           ↓
      Model Evaluation
           ↓
        ML Model
           ↓
   SageMaker Endpoint
           ↓
     Predictions
           ↓
      Monitoring
           ↓
   New Data / Retraining

====

